LUNDY LOOP MASTER PACK — VERSION 3.1 (JULY 2026)
Matt Roper · Progress Schools Tees Valley · Feedback & Marking Policy 2025/26 (Pilot)

START
1. Extract the ZIP. 2. Open index.html in any browser. 3. Print any page to A4 via the browser's Print function.

WHAT'S IN v3 (merges the original Rollout Pack with Curriculum Pack v2.1, plus a new launch layer)
1_whole_school   — Whole-School Reference (v2) + Day-to-Day desk sheet (5 steps + weekly loop log)
2_leadership     — Policy alignment, implementation/risk plan, QA coaching sheet,
                   Ofsted LAUNCH sheet (start at the 10-minute walk), Impact Framework, Impact Monitoring Crib,
                   Loop Walk Logger (phone-first learning-walk app; data stays on the device; exports the QA CSV),
                   Head Office Summary (HTML + PDF, two pages, for Charlotte and Chloe)
3_subject_guides — Ten subject dialects, Science to RE & Citizenship
4_send_and_pupils— SEND Overlay (triage + four areas + JCQ link), Loop Passports (per-pupil, print one page each),
                   Pupil One-Pagers (BUILD symbol-supported / GROW / LAUNCH)
5_staff_training — 25-minute twilight INSET running order, interactive R-gate calibration game
                   (also prints as scenario cards), five-minute briefing, calibration examples
6_posters        — Ten in-class visual guides (PNG) with QR footers linking to the hosted subject guides
                   (QRs assume the pack lives at mattroper1977.github.io/Lessons/LundyLoop/ — see the
                   separate GitHub Pages bundle for deployment)
templates        — Subject planning prompt, QA sample log, weekly loop log (CSV)

FOR THE SEPTEMBER LAUNCH: 5_staff_training/INSET_Twilight_25min.html is the running order;
put R_Gate_Calibration_Game.html on the screen; print five_minute_briefing.html as the takeaway.

STATUS
Draft implementation companion, not a replacement for approved policy. Approved Feedback & Marking,
Curriculum, SEND, Safeguarding and qualification requirements take precedence.
Completed Loop Passports contain provision information — store with SEND records.

THE ONE NON-NEGOTIABLE
R only after genuine Audience. No evidence created solely for audit. Disclosure firewall always wins.
